OL,3,CProgramme listings for
OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 11 JAN
OL,4,G1800FMary Anne Hobbs
OL,5,     GMary Anne celebrates Bowie's
OL,6,     Galbum Low with Tony Visconti,
OL,7,     GIggy Pop, Anna Calvi, and a visit
OL,8,     Gto the Bowie Archive at V&A
OL,9,     GStorehouse East to share some
OL,10,     Gunseen gems from the Low Era.
OL,11,G2000FStuart Maconie's Freak Zone
OL,12,     GThe Freak Zone joins in 6 Music's
OL,13,     Gcelebration of David Bowie in its
OL,14,     Gown unique way with a collection
OL,15,     Gof obscurities, cover versions,
OL,16,     Ginfluences and the influenced.
OL,17,G2200FDream Time
OL,18,     GZakia Sewell brings the sunshine
OL,19,     Gwith a stack of records from her
OL,20,     Grecent trip to Brazil, with
OL,21,     Gplenty of samba and saudade
OL,22,     Gsounds.
